{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Antivirus PROTOCOL</strong> is an incremental game about destroying viruses. Learn and adapt, collect data, upgrade yourself, and eliminate the Virus that has taken over the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTROY VIRUSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1747237442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect various code fragments and data from viruses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/skilltree.gif?t=1747237442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the collected data to upgrade yourself and unlock\u00a0powerful new weapons and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CLEAR THE LEVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/bossfight.gif?t=1747237442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill the Virus Boss at the end of the level to progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance through levels to unlock new enemies and gather more data.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple resources to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive upgrade tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of unique weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing, satisfying gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716650?t=1747237442","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716650?t=1747237442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371